You are working on PharmaFlow AI.

Repo: /Users/manitdankhara/Projects/pharmaflow-ai
Stack: React + Vite + TypeScript + Tailwind frontend, Express + Prisma backend, Twilio Voice, Vercel deploy.
Production URL: https://pharmaflow-ai.vercel.app

Rules:
- Use fake/masked demo data only. Do not include real PHI.
- Do not log DOB, medication details, or patient-sensitive details.
- Do not work on SMS unless explicitly requested again.
- Do not commit .env, .env.local, server/.env, server/local.config.json, node_modules, dist, server/dist, or database files.
- Run npm run build before deploy/commit.
- Deploy with npx vercel@latest deploy --prod --yes using the existing Vercel project.
- Verify production with curl https://pharmaflow-ai.vercel.app/api/health and browser QA on changed routes.
- Vercel SQLite is demo-only. Real call status persistence requires a Postgres DATABASE_URL.
- Keep UI pharmacy-friendly, clean, responsive, and easy for non-technical staff.

Useful commands:
- npm run dev:pc
- npm run api:kill-old
- npm run build
- npm run build --prefix server
- npx vercel@latest deploy --prod --yes
